{"id":"W5ee99f16efb60c76b5615f17","zh":"随机分析","en":"","name":"随机分析","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"random analysis 与 stochastic analysis 在所引文献中并用，不能将两词在全部数学语境中视为无条件同义。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W5ee99f16efb60c76b5615f17","text":"随机分析","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S9ac26790173c566864d6","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"依据车辆-轨道耦合动力学和随机分析理论,建立了用于横风、轨道随机不平顺联合分析的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sd32ce548130397b2c60f","source_id":"P111","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"故而, 若要合理进行风环境下车辆-轨道系统的随机分析及可靠性评估,则应该妥善考虑各主要激振源的参振作用。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"Sace76ddf877e666caf36","source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于随机分析理论,考虑线路不平顺及系统动力参数的时-空随机演变特性,将车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论与概率密度演化方法结合,提出一种用于线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S9c75390225063ba23c59","source_id":"P112","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"文献[4]在结构随机分析方面发展了一类概率密度演化方法,用于解决系统随机激扰-振动响应间的概率密度传递问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"Sd96edc94145be99dd6e2","source_id":"P127","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"蒙特卡罗法原则上适用于任意线性、 非线性系统的静、动力随机分析,然而其分析精度往往需要大量的计算样本,因此MCM 是以计算效率作为代价。","citations":[{"source_id":"P127","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S65df86732c9184965e13","source_id":"P127","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"zh","text":"因此,在车-轨-桥耦合系统随机分析时, 考虑车辆质量和桥梁弹性模量的随机性是十分必要的。","citations":[{"source_id":"P127","page":10,"page_end":10}]}],"sources":{"P001":{"id":"P001","title":"A new model for temporal–spatial stochastic analysis of vehicle–track coupled systems","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2017","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2016.1270456","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 55 (3), 427-448","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-temporal-spatial-stochastic-analysis"},"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"},"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"},"P127":{"id":"P127","title":"基于直接概率积分法的列车-轨道-桥梁系统随机分析","authors":"刘虎兵,宋力,徐磊,蒋丽忠,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20230440","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"刘虎兵等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-stochastic-analysis-of-vehicle-track-bridge-system-based-on-direct-probability-integral-method"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"同时处理不平顺和结构参数的不确定性，描述响应的统计特征。","language":"zh","source_id":"P112","paper_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"在系统参数或激励具有随机性的条件下研究系统响应及其统计特征。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"C1254a5657d0289451ece"},{"text":"在系统参数或激励具有随机性的条件下研究系统响应及其统计特征。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C6ab9700a7aa5798faf44"},{"text":"在系统参数或激励具有随机性的条件下分析系统响应。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 随机分析","concept_id":"C7f6fd21d0555aeda6e3c"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W851912c72d4637f2ed5cda2f","na